blockers.detail:
So far only configure, -fsyntax-only and a toy link have been run. Not yet attempted:
- linking libnvptxcompiler_static.a (a 96 MB sbsa archive, judged PIC from one member only) into the shared nv_attach_impl_ptx_compiler and 19 runtime-linked targets;
- the three pass .so files with static LLVM 15;
- bpftime_runtime_tests with CUDA ON, which upstream CI never builds.
The board has 7.5 GB RAM, about 3.9 GB available and no swap, so LTO plus several concurrent static-LLVM links risks running out of memory. Our dev branch changed CUDA-gated runtime files by +1628 lines; with CUDA ON they have only been syntax-checked.
